  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000s8ec](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000s8ec) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 168.98 depth occurred on Mar 28 2026 53km E of Hila. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.5311 longitude 127.8465. It impacted 1545 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
